      "cooked": "<p>I hade made some JS changes for sidebar in my custom app(Yana EFRIS). After that I have deployed my changes to the live site from Frappe Cloud. I have also performed migrate action but still my changes are not getting reflected on live site.</p>\n<p>This is the first time I am dealing with this type of issue. Till now I have deployed many times from Frappe Cloud but didn’t faced any issue.</p>\n<p>Here I am also attaching the helpful screenshots.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/4/f48e229c39c6513c78417310bc38c72d1c87da04.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f48e229c39c6513c78417310bc38c72d1c87da04\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/4/f48e229c39c6513c78417310bc38c72d1c87da04_2_690x338.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"yTr1C6PtlctAxzJXK8B2HPPAHEU\" width=\"690\" height=\"338\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/4/f48e229c39c6513c78417310bc38c72d1c87da04_2_690x338.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/4/f48e229c39c6513c78417310bc38c72d1c87da04_2_1035x507.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/4/f48e229c39c6513c78417310bc38c72d1c87da04_2_1380x676.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"B0CAE7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1919×942 106 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/4/848f9431a1d268c75bf107629cddd154e3fc19b0.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/848f9431a1d268c75bf10762